WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:17.760
Last time: if · then · else blocks

3
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:27.700
Unit 3 · Chapter 5 of 5 · the last one!

4
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.150
Chapter 5 · My First Mini Program

5
00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:42.630
Today, you build your own program!

6
00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:49.040
Meet Arjun, a brand new coder

7
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.510
Goal: Billu walks, then says Hello!

8
00:00:53.510 --> 00:01:02.100
No plan… grab blocks, snap, click!

9
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:11.470
Oops! Hello came first… then it vanished!

10
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:19.070
What went wrong? Think!

11
00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:33.040
Real coders follow four simple steps

12
00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:40.910
Idea → Blocks → Test → Fix

13
00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:55.720
Decide · Plan & snap · Watch · Repair

14
00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:04.400
Step one is always: pick an idea

15
00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:17.980
Keep it tiny: cat walks, then says hello

16
00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:27.390
Or a joke: Dino asks a funny question

17
00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:38.040
50 blocks, 10 characters? Too big!

18
00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:49.430
Plan on paper: which blocks, what order

19
00:02:49.430 --> 00:03:08.140
Start · Move · Move · Say Hello!

20
00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:18.600
Start + 2 motions + 1 say = a great plan

21
00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:27.390
Snap blocks in the same order as the plan

22
00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:37.310
"When green flag clicked" starts it all

23
00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:50.320
Test: click the flag and watch closely

24
00:03:50.320 --> 00:04:02.410
Bug = a mistake you didn't plan

25
00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:15.100
Bugs are normal. Every coder finds them!

26
00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:29.630
Cat says hello BEFORE walking. Fix it?

27
00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:40.150
Move the say block below the move blocks

28
00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:54.310
Cat walks off the edge. Which block helps?

29
00:04:54.310 --> 00:05:04.930
if touching edge then bounce!

30
00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:13.960
Share one thing you changed after testing

31
00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:29.580
Put these steps back in order!

32
00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:42.050
Idea → Blocks → Test → Fix

33
00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:48.620
Your turn: practice check

34
00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:58.980
List the blocks: cat walks, then says hello

35
00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:15.940
Flag → Move 10 → Move 10 → Say Hello!

36
00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:24.290
Idea → Blocks → Test → Fix

37
00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:29.060
Plan: start + 2 motions + 1 say

38
00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:33.870
Bugs are normal: find them, fix them

39
00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.810
Share one thing you changed

40
00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:49.020
Chapter 5 done · Unit 3 complete!

41
00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:55.820
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
